sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Pegawai as "Pegawai"
    participant View as "Web View (employee.leaves.create)"
    participant Controller as "Employee LeaveController"
    participant Model as "LeaveRequest Model"
    participant DB as "Database"

    Pegawai->>View: Isi formulir lalu klik Ajukan Cuti
    View->>Controller: POST /employee/leaves
    Controller->>Controller: Validasi input + cek bentrok tanggal
    Controller->>Model: Proses create data cuti
    Model->>DB: INSERT leave_requests + attachment_path
    DB-->>Model: Data cuti tersimpan
    Model-->>Controller: Permohonan cuti berhasil dibuat

    alt Data valid (kuota cukup, tanggal valid, tidak bentrok)
        Controller->>View: Redirect index + success
        View-->>Pegawai: Notifikasi pengajuan berhasil
    else Data tidak valid (kuota habis, tanggal salah, bentrok, validasi gagal)
        Controller->>View: Back + error
        View-->>Pegawai: Notifikasi gagal mengajukan cuti
    end
